# Layer A density v4 form of corpus/38-handler-nested-innermost-wins.json
# — nested handlers for Time.Now. Innermost (returns 2) wins. Uses the
# implicit prelude for intT, nowFx, nowT, now (the latter three carry
# the Time.Now effect declaration as their reserved-node spec).
@v=1 root=outer
callNow APP now []
innerLam LAM [] 2
inner H nowFx innerLam callNow
outerLam LAM [] 1
outer H nowFx outerLam inner
